warsi (0.10.1~git202611151954.1e2931e4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New snapshot from github.com/BlankOn/bazaar main at 1e2931e4: use GTK's
    Cairo renderer where GL only runs in software (llvmpipe, e.g. a virtual
    machine without 3D acceleration). GTK's GPU renderers compiled shaders
    on the main thread there, so opening the Search tab froze the window
    for 10-20 seconds ("not responding", crashes). Real GPUs keep the GL
    renderer; GSK_RENDERER still overrides (ai-patches/DIFF.md hook H13).

 -- Herpiko Dwi Aguno <herpiko@gmail.com>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:54:47 +0700

warsi (0.10.1~git202611151833.67a3245a-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New snapshot from github.com/BlankOn/bazaar main at 67a3245a: desktop
    file keywords "Warung Aplikasi", "Bazaar" and "GNOME Software", and the
    English search words in every translation, so app launchers (Praya,
    GNOME Shell) find Warsi by "warsi", "warung aplikasi", "store",
    "software", "gnome software" and "bazaar" in English and Indonesian.
  * Snapshot versions now carry the commit time (YYYYMMDDHHMM), so two
    snapshots of the same day sort by time, not by commit hash.

 -- Herpiko Dwi Aguno <herpiko@gmail.com>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:33:39 +0700

