 -- Herpiko Dwi Aguno <herpiko@gmail.com>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:10:25 +0700

warsi (0.10.1~git20261115.bae31466-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build-Depends: libdex-dev (>= 1.2~beta) instead of (>= 1.2.0). libdex's
    symbols file takes warsi's minimum libdex-1-1 version from this field,
    and sinambung only has 1.2~beta-2, so -1 was not installable. Every
    libdex symbol warsi uses exists in 1.2~beta.

 -- Herpiko Dwi Aguno <herpiko@gmail.com>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:51:59 +0700

